          "guid": "mt44ihowwssil61h",
          "message": {
            "text": "The exact crop is safe only while both real closed-shadow siblings retain identity and geometry. Isolation hides the status span, restores the upload button's own text fill, validates closed-root ownership/quads and interaction state, and later requires complete style/node restoration; the focused browser test also proves the full-page screenshot is byte-identical before and after capture.",
            "markdown": "The exact crop is safe only while both real closed-shadow siblings retain identity and geometry. Isolation hides the status span, restores the upload button's own text fill, validates closed-root ownership/quads and interaction state, and later requires complete style/node restoration; the focused browser test also proves the full-page screenshot is byte-identical before and after capture."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/capture/native-control-decoration-raster.ts"
